Z||000002||Eric||07-04-99||09:32 AM||||I was thinking of putting some white graphics (stripes) down the sides of my black 88GT.  I never have like the black as much as red or yellow.  I don't think it attracts as much attention.  I also want to paint the wheels white to match.  As far as "go fast" stickers go, I don't like them much either.  My old Celica had red brake calipers.  I think the contrast between white wheels red calipers would look good, even on a Fiero.  Guess I'm more of a rice boy than I thought.
