Z||000004||Eric||07-04-99||08:03 PM||||Summit doesn't mean anything.  Around here every goofball slaps Jeg's stickers on his 85 S10.  If you really want your Fiero to look fast, you need not add a bunch of big ugly stickers all over the car.  You're better off putting a select few on the side an one above the air intake on the front fashia.  Or better yet, a windshield sticker, so everyone who sees you through their rearview will know they are about to be passed.
